                                "sense_id": "6dbcbb18-72a0-3168-9b6a-5dfa0de1cc0c",
                                "text": "So you were thrilled, and we picked out the mare for Harriet, and you bagsed the black, and I had the chestnut, and we all rode away one day."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f0fb486-3084-4945-8aad-857d29b1d699",
                                "sense_id": "6dbcbb18-72a0-3168-9b6a-5dfa0de1cc0c",
                                "text": "Mum bagsed being the priestess who got to dangle Stone over the volcano by his ankles."
                            },
                            {
