                                "sense_id": "6dbcbb18-72a0-3168-9b6a-5dfa0de1cc0c",
                                "text": "Battered armchairs and a sofa were bagsed first; they were more comfortable than the school chairs that could get hard."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "43d2d30a-d3ea-44de-8de7-e007a042d3e7",
                                "sense_id": "6dbcbb18-72a0-3168-9b6a-5dfa0de1cc0c",
                                "text": "‘Hey, it′s my turn in the front,’ Kalista called as she realised her brother had bagsed the front seat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe558846-a97f-44d0-b2ba-2488ba787d41",
                                "sense_id": "6dbcbb18-72a0-3168-9b6a-5dfa0de1cc0c",
                                "text": "They used to share the water as kids, and for some reason Irene always managed to bags the first bath; Riva made do with the soapy second."
